# MoyKlass access for BotNastya

## Prefer API first
- Use `MOYKLASS_API_KEY` from project `.env` (never commit secrets).
- Auth: `POST https://api.moyklass.com/v1/company/auth/getToken` with `{"apiKey": "..."}`.
- Then call company endpoints with header `x-access-token`.
- Use API for: users, lessons, lessonRecords, joins, managers, subscriptions, webhooks testing via bot endpoints.

## Browser (Playwright MCP) for UI-only work
- Use Playwright MCP when API cannot do it: MoyKlass **Сценарии**, scheduled/deferred sends, UI toggles, visual checks.
- Login URL is typically `https://app.moyklass.com` (or the school’s MoyKlass cabinet).
- Profile is persisted in `.playwright-moyklass-profile` so login can be reused after the human logs in once.
- Do not store passwords in git. If session expired, ask the user to log in once in the opened browser window.

## Safety
- Keep `MOYKLASS_WEBHOOK_TEST_PHONE` set while testing CRM→WhatsApp so parents are not spammed.
- Prefer dry-runs / test phone before clearing test mode.
- Never disable rate limits completely; raise caps carefully if needed.
